    skos:definition "A concern raised by employees, contractors, users, or other interested parties about the organization's role with respect to an AI system. Operationalises Annex A.3.3 (Reporting of concerns). Confidentiality, anonymity, anti-reprisal protection, escalation, and timely response are core attributes; informed by ISO 37002." ;
