        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/MLApproach#semi_supervised>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/MLApproach#supervised>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/MLApproach#symbolic>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/MLApproach#transfer>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/iso42001/MLApproach#unsupervised> .

